.TH KANBAN-APP 1 "September 2026" "kan-bone-rs 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
kanban-app \- manage Kanban boards in the COSMIC desktop
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kanban-app
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B kanban-app
opens the KanBone graphical application. Cards are stored in a local SQLite
database and can be organised into Kanban boards.
.PP
A graphical Wayland session is required.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kanban-applet (1)
